<title>CHINA: SOCCER-STANDINGS IN CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-STANDINGS IN CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the standings in</p>
<p>China's soccer league after the 13th round of matches played on</p>
<p>Sunday (tabulated under games played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, against and points):</p>
<p> Dalian Wanda	 13   10    3    0   26    7   33</p>
<p> Beijing Guo'an     13    6    5    2   28   14   23</p>
<p> Qingdao Hainiu     13    5    5    3   11    8   20</p>
<p> Shanghai Shenhua   13    4    5    4   17   17   17</p>
<p> Yanbian Aodong     13    4    5    4   11   12   17</p>
<p> Vanguards Huandao  13    4    3    6   16   18   15</p>
<p> Guangzhou Apollo   13    2    6    5    4   12   12</p>
<p> Tianjin Samsung    13    2    5    6    8   16   11</p>
<p> Guangdong Hongyuan 13    3    2    8   10   21   11</p>
